              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\n\r\n<i class='fa fa-youtube-play' aria-hidden='true'></i> Wet Blocking\r\n\r\n<br>Instead of steam, try wet blocking. This technique is especially good for natural fibers.<br>\r\nWhatever method you use, blocking is essential for a professional finish.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/27/summer_tee/blocking2.jpg\">\r\n<div class='embed-video-container'>\n<iframe src='https://player.vimeo.com/video/151858072' frameborder='0' webkitAllowFullScreen mozallowfullscreen allowFullScreen></iframe>\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
